aims-os-branding (2.1+1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Dark-mode wallpaper: aims-os-default-dark-{1080p,4k}.png (same logo
    on warm charcoal #2A282B). Wired through picture-uri-dark and the
    wallpaper picker manifest (<filename-dark>), so GNOME swaps the
    background when the user picks the dark style. The dconf default
    now ships in this package (01-aims-os-branding, dconf update in
    postinst) so already-installed machines get it on upgrade.

 -- AIMS Senegal IT <hakim@aims-senegal.org>  Fri, 04 Sep 2026 13:00:00 +0000

aims-os-branding (2.1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Plymouth: the rotating ray ring is now 30 pre-rendered frames
    (ImageMagick, anti-aliased) cycled by the script instead of a
    runtime Image.Rotate(), which showed dashes of uneven length on
    real hardware (HP All-in-One 24-f0xx, 2026-09-03).
  * Now built and published in the apt repo as well as the ISO.

 -- AIMS Senegal IT <hakim@aims-senegal.org>  Thu, 03 Sep 2026 20:00:00 +0000

